message: "If you use this project, please cite it as below."
title: "Hit or Flop: pre-release prediction of Indian film success with honest chronological evaluation"
type: software
version: 2.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/tonymadhuri2088-cmd/movie-hit-flop"
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - film
  - binary classification
  - temporal validation
  - calibration
abstract: >-
  Predicts whether an Indian film will be a Hit (revenue at least twice its budget) using only information available before release.
  Every claim is checked with chronological validation, a frozen test set and paired-bootstrap intervals.
